Maintainer: Christof Laenzlinger <christof@laenzlinger.ch>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/pedalboard/pedalboard-os

Package: pedalboard-os
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
 pedalboard-bridge,
 jackd2,
 adduser,
 systemd,
 calf-plugins,
 guitarix-lv2
Recommends: mod-host
Description: Pedalboard OS — systemd services and configuration for CM5
 Installs and manages all systemd units, systemd targets, udev rules,
 runtime configuration, and audio rig preset for the pedalboard audio
 system running on a Compute Module 5.
 .
 Depends on pedalboard-bridge for the JACK MIDI + audio switching service,
 calf-plugins and guitarix-lv2 for the default audio rig.
 AIDA-X (rt-neural-generic) must be installed separately via make deps.
 .
 Includes gig mode (pedalboard-gig.target) and studio mode
 (pedalboard-dev.target) for switching between minimal audio-only
 and full development stack at runtime.
